    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Henry Kee & Son are delighted to present to the market this 30.66 acre farm of good quality farmland. Located within 2km of Stranorlar Main Street the farm benefits from having both public road frontage plus a good quality private road on its southern boundary. The farm has been rented for many years and is slightly neglected however with a little improvement works it could easily be restored to top quality farmland. Superb panoramic views over the Twin Towns, the surrounding Finn Valley and westwards towards the Bluestack mountains are to be had from various fields throughout the farm. This combination of being close to town with good access and a dream rural setting all indicate strong residential site appeal (subject to planning permission).\nOffered for sale in the following lots\nLOT 1 - 26 AcresLOT 2 - 2.12 AcresLOT 3 - 2.54 AcresLOT 4 - The Entire\nMaps and further details available on enquiry."
      },
